				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>The Little Elm HVAC Team That Treats Every Customer Like Family</h2>
<p>Air Zone Experts is a family-owned HVAC company serving the Dallas-Fort Worth area from its home base in Little Elm, Texas. Founded in 2008, the company has spent over 15 years helping homeowners and businesses stay comfortable through North Texas’s sweltering summers and unpredictable winters. With more than 400 five-star reviews on Google and a reputation built almost entirely on referrals, Air Zone Experts stands apart from the competition in every city across Denton, Collin, and Dallas counties.</p>
<p>Owner Adrian Racovei is a NATE-certified HVACR technician and EPA Section 608 certified professional who personally handles many service calls. That owner-led approach defines everything about the Air Zone Experts experience — transparent pricing, honest recommendations, and the kind of workmanship that keeps customers calling back year after year.</p></div>
